OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy first thing with some
OL,6,Foutbreaks of mostly light rain.
OL,7,FOtherwise mostly dry with some bright
OL,8,For sunny spells developing but also
OL,9,Fthe chance of a few sharp showers.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FAny showers soon fading out
OL,12,Fto leave a dry night with some clear
OL,13,Fspells, perhaps cloudier at times in
OL,14,Fthe south and around the Isles. Winds
OL,15,Ffalling light.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA dry and bright start with
OL,18,Fsome good sunny spells through much of
OL,19,Fthe day. Outbreaks of rain spread east
OL,20,Fthrough the afternoon and evening,
OL,21,Fstaying dry for North Argyll.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
