OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRain or
OL,6,Fshowers at times, occasionally heavy,
OL,7,Falong with some drier and brighter
OL,8,Fspells. Winds will be mostly light on
OL,9,FSunday but likely freshening on Monday
OL,10,Fand Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
